<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>One counting another’s failures,</l><l>Unwritten yet in the mind,</l><l>Uncovering one’s behavior,</l><l>Forgetting that love is blind.</l><l>Exchanges provoke us easily</l><l>When short of the loving cure.</l><l>When filled with divine love then we see</l><l>Love endures.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
